hared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/232ab8c09296cd40bee69906de64af8d.poster.avif?t=1763107159\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/232ab8c09296cd40bee69906de64af8d.webm?t=1763107159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/232ab8c09296cd40bee69906de64af8d.mp4?t=1763107159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/b79107c2a7cfb78aa163115cbd120d7b.avif?t=1763107159\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras_big/b79107c2a7cfb78aa163115cbd120d7b.avif?t=1763107159 width=800 height=73 /></span>As Natalia Asensio, Grand Master of an ancient esoteric order, society collapses around you with the appearance of ghosts and the shattering of dimensional barriers. Trapped in a dusty basement, drugged and barely remembering your identity, you must engage in a battle of wills that could open the gates of hell. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/ccaa1b61dfc9380ba4b680c4a5bd48c8.poster.avif?t=1763107159\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/ccaa1b61dfc9380ba4b680c4a5bd48c8.webm?t=1763107159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089630/extras/ccaa1b61dfc9380ba4b680c4a5bd48c8.mp4?t=1763107159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"h